{"id": "EUVD-2026-108292", "enisaUuid": "e97245fb-9103-33db-8eee-ecefb8b48235", "description": "OpenBao from 2.5.0 before 2.6.2 fails to enforce the PKI role allowed_ip_sans_cidr restriction on IP SANs taken from a CSR when use_csr_sans is enabled. Authenticated callers with sign permission can submit a CSR with an out-of-range IP SAN to pki/sign/<role> and obtain CA-signed certificates for unauthorized IPs.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:40", "baseScore": 2.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openbao/openbao/security/advisories/GHSA-g892-p242-8g86", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openbao-2.5.0-before-2.6.2-pki-allowed-ip-sans-cidr-bypass-via-csr-ip-sans"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115369", "GHSA-65vq-mjjr-475v"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "57d3e86c-afdf-3665-8aaf-b5c1313aa08f", "product": {"name": "openbao", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}, "product_version": "2.5.0 <2.6.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9b601aba-a09c-3112-9abf-37bc51e591f8", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}], "isExploited": false}